Install the DLLs into bin (a RUNTIME destination is needed on Cygwin).

Do not put dbus-cxx/ on the include path of the tools, tests and examples.
Its signal.h shadows the system <signal.h>, which Cygwin's <pthread.h>
includes, so no standard header compiles. The headers are found through
the dbus-cxx target's include directories instead.

